      "writtenOn": "2024-02-26T14:59:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I investigated making a module here. The challenge is that almost all of our built-in runtime effects evaluate a child effect, because they are shading _something_ (an image, a solid color, a gradient, etc). We don\u0027t support passing shaders into functions today, because that would require basically a template expansion. However, it would be _super useful_ and I could totally be convinced that it is worth some R\u0026D time, if that is an angle we want to pursue. I think it\u0027s just a matter of justifying the engineering time to do it.",
      "parentUuid": "612d4c85_93fd8373",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 67,
        "startChar": 17,
        "endLine": 67,
        "endChar": 38
      },
